From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Play online through the profile's public relay, with a room

A profile can name a public ad hoc server (adhoc_relay_server). The Network page gets a Room and a Play online button: the room is folded into the product code the game logs in with, so players in different rooms never meet on the relay and the server and login format are unchanged. When the relay cannot be reached in 12 s, the game hosts directly with an opened router port and shows the address to share.
---

diff --git a/host/adhoc/host.cpp b/host/adhoc/host.cpp
index 4124933..ac509c6 100644
--- a/host/adhoc/host.cpp
+++ b/host/adhoc/host.cpp
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <mutex>
+#include <random>
 
 namespace portablekit {
 namespace {
@@ -125,6 +126,25 @@ void adhoc_shutdown() noexcept {
     adhoc::Client::get().shutdown();
 }
 
+std::string adhoc_new_room() {
+    // No 0/O or 1/I: a room code is read out to a friend.
+    static constexpr char kLetters[] = "ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWXYZ23456789";
+    std::random_device random;
+    std::string room;
+    for (int i = 0; i < 4; ++i) room += kLetters[random() % (sizeof(kLetters) - 1u)];
+    return room;
+}
+
+bool adhoc_join_relay() {
+    const std::string relay = adhoc_relay_address();
+    if (relay.empty()) return false;
+    settings::Settings &s = settings::current();
+    if (adhoc_room_code(s.adhoc_room).empty() && settings::overridden_by("network.room").empty())
+        s.adhoc_room = adhoc_new_room();
+    adhoc_join(relay);
+    return true;
+}
+
